  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>「HardRock Tools &amp; Materials」</strong>附加包 與 <strong>「Create」</strong>模組為<strong>必備</strong>，此模組才能完整運作<br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hardrock-tools-materials\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hardrock-tools-materials</a></span><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/874/head.png\" width=\"597\" height=\"326\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>============================================================================</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">大部分配方已修改，並以物品手冊應用原理運作。</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">這並不表示配方變得更簡單，只是以不同方式生產。<br>這是一種更直觀且更具手動操作性的方式，用來創造 Create 模組的所有物品。</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">與 Create 模組本體相容，且不會與其他模組衝突。</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\"><strong>透過繞過工作檯，取代現有的 Create 配方</strong><br><strong>物品透過逐一添加部件生產，直到最終物品完成。</strong><br><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">============================================================================</span><br><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#36f\"> 全新合成系統</span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/579/pokaz2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"795\" height=\"383\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/586/pokaz1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"833\" height=\"454\">================================================================================<br><span style=\"color:#396;font-size:18px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:24px\">全新物品與零件</span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/774/multi3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"878\" height=\"479\"></span>==============================================================================<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/582/img.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"641\" height=\"393\"><br></strong></span></h2>",
